+- **THE CAVEAT WAS WRONG ON HALF ITS CLAIM. The exp5836 A/B path loads NO per-game GameAdapter.**
+  `_explorer_policy` builds `CarnotAgentPolicy(game, {}, force_explore=True)`; `solutions={}`
